<!-- The S.D. Iowa complaint's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the face of the
     typst template ({font}, Times New Roman) at 12 pt (size 24 half points); Body Text in exact 24 pt line boxes (typst
     pitch, LR 10(b)(1) double spaced) with a half-inch indent, and the headings in them with 12 pt above and below;
     the caption, quotation, signature and footer lines in 13.8 pt boxes (typst pitch-single); letter page with 1-inch
     margins (LR 10(b)(3): top at least 1 inch) and a centered page number (LR 10(b)), its line 36.6 pt above the page
     foot (732 twips: where typst sets it, footer-descent 30 %). docx/iasd-complaint.lua writes every paragraph's own
     spacing. Twips: 20 x pt. -->
<reference xmlns:w="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" base="xengine" size="24" body="480" single="276" indent="720" heading="480" heading-before="240" heading-after="240" footer="732"/>
